#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:144
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Mutter"
msgstr "Instalação do Mutter"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:155
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Fix an issue with the tests that would otherwise require the package to be "
"built with debugging information:"
msgstr ""
"Corrija um problema com os testes que, de outra forma, exigiriam que o "
"pacote fosse construído com informações de depuração:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:159
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed \"/tests_c_args =/s/$/ + ['-U', 'G_DISABLE_ASSERT']/\" -i src/tests/meson.build &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed \"/c_args:/a '-U', 'G_DISABLE_ASSERT',\" -i src/tests/cogl/unit/meson.build</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed \"/tests_c_args =/s/$/ + ['-U', 'G_DISABLE_ASSERT']/\" -i src/tests/meson.build &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed \"/c_args:/a '-U', 'G_DISABLE_ASSERT',\" -i src/tests/cogl/unit/meson.build</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:163
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Mutter</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>Mutter</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:167
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr            \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release      \\\n"
"            -D tests=disabled        \\\n"
"            -D profiler=false        \\\n"
"            -D bash_completion=false \\\n"
"            ..                       &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr            \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release      \\\n"
"            -D tests=disabled        \\\n"
"            -D profiler=false        \\\n"
"            -D bash_completion=false \\\n"
"            ..                       &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:198
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you want to run the test suite, ensure <xref linkend='python-dbusmock'/> "
"is installed and issue:"
msgstr ""
"Se você quiser executar a suíte de teste, certifique-se de que <xref "
"linkend='python-dbusmock'/> esteja instalado e emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:202
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>meson configure -D tests=enabled &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja test</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>meson configure -D tests=enabled &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja test</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:206
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The tests require an active X or wayland session.  Some tests are flaky "
"(especially under a high system load) so if a test fails you can try to re-"
"run it alone with the <command>meson test <replaceable>&lt;test "
"name&gt;</replaceable></command> command.  A few tests may fail depending on"
" some system configuration.  Don't make any mouse or keyboard input while "
"the test suite is running or some tests may fail.  You can also test basic "
"functions of <application>Mutter</application> following <xref "
"linkend='mutter-starting' role=','/> after installing it."
msgstr ""
"Os testes exigem uma sessão ativa do X ou do wayland. Alguns testes são "
"instáveis (especialmente sob uma carga alta do sistema), de forma que se um "
"teste falhar, você pode tentar executá-lo novamente sozinho com o comando "
"<command>meson test <replaceable>&lt;nome teste&gt;</replaceable></command>."
" Alguns testes possivelmente falhem dependendo de alguma configuração do "
"sistema. Não faça nenhuma entrada de mouse ou de teclado enquanto a suíte de"
" teste estiver executando ou alguns testes possivelmente falhem. Você também"
" consegue testar funções básicas do <application>Mutter</application> "
"seguindo <xref linkend='mutter-starting' role=','/> depois de instalá-lo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:220
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:223
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:228
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:234
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D bash_completion=false</parameter>: Allows building the package"
" without the <ulink url=\"https://github.com/scop/bash-completion/\">bash-"
"completion</ulink> package installed."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D bash_completion=false</parameter>: Permite construir o pacote "
"sem o pacote <ulink url=\"https://github.com/scop/bash-completion/\">bash-"
"completion</ulink> instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:241
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D tests=disabled</parameter>: Allow building the package without"
" <xref linkend='python-dbusmock'/> installed.  It'll be overridden with "
"<command>meson configure</command> if running the test suite."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D tests=disabled</parameter>: Permite construir o pacote sem "
"<xref linkend='python-dbusmock'/> instalado. Ele será substituído por "
"<command>meson configure</command> se executar a suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:248
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D profiler=false</parameter>: Allows building this package "
"without <application>Sysprof</application>.  Remove this option if you've "
"installed <application>Sysprof</application> and want to analyze the "
"rendering performance of <application>Mutter</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D profiler=false</parameter>: Permite construir esse pacote sem "
"<application>Sysprof</application>. Remova essa opção se você não tiver "
"instalado o <application>Sysprof</application> e desejar analisar o "
"desempenho de renderização do <application>Mutter</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:264
#, xml-text
msgid "Starting Mutter"
msgstr "Iniciando o Mutter"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:273
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>Mutter</application> is normally used as a component of "
"<application>gnome-shell</application>, but it can be used as a standalone "
"Wayland compositor too.  To run <application>Mutter</application> as a "
"Wayland compositor, in a virtual console, issue:"
msgstr ""
"<application>Mutter</application> normalmente é usado como um componente do "
"<application>gnome-shell</application>, mas também pode ser usado como um "
"compositor autônomo Wayland. Para executar <application>Mutter</application>"
" como um compositor Wayland, em um console virtual, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:280
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>mutter --wayland -- vte-2.91</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>mutter --wayland -- vte-2.91</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:283
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Replace <command>vte-2.91</command> with the command line for the first "
"application you want in the Wayland session. Note that once this application"
" exits, the Wayland session will be terminated."
msgstr ""
"Substitua <command>vte-2.91</command> pela linha de comando do primeiro "
"aplicativo que você deseja na sessão do Wayland. Observe que assim que esse "
"aplicativo sair, a sessão do Wayland será terminada."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:289
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>Mutter</application> can also function as a nested compositor "
"in another Wayland session.  In a terminal emulator, issue:"
msgstr ""
"<application>Mutter</application> também pode funcionar como um compositor "
"aninhado em outra sessão do Wayland. Em um emulador de terminal, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:293
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>MUTTER_DEBUG_DUMMY_MODE_SPECS=1920x1080 mutter --wayland --nested"
" -- vte-2.91</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>MUTTER_DEBUG_DUMMY_MODE_SPECS=1920x1080 mutter --wayland --nested"
" -- vte-2.91</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/mutter.xml:296
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Replace <replaceable>1920x1080</replaceable> with the size you want for the "
"nested Wayland session."
msgstr ""
"Substitua <replaceable>1920x1080</replaceable> pelo tamanho que você quiser "
"para a sessão aninhada do Wayland."

