msgid ""
"contains the <application>Mutter</application> test suite API functions; "
"this library is only installed if the test suite of this package is run and "
"it is needed by the <application>gnome-shell</application> test suite"
msgstr ""
"contém as funções de API da suíte de teste do "
"<application>Mutter</application>; essa biblioteca só é instalada se a suíte"
" de teste desse pacote for executada e for necessária para a suíte de teste "
"do <application>gnome-shell</application>"

